# @hub-lanes

# ── STAFF QUARTERMASTER LEVER (BH-10123, C2 of #9423) ───────────────────────
# Hourly at :49 (not a fly-idle-reaper pass minute, 2-59/5). Samples
# orphan_usd_day: the $/day of started Fly machines with no job row for more
# than staff.quartermaster.idle_min minutes (GET /api/fly-idle), plus the $/day
# of idle Orgo capacity (catalog/orgo-plans.json pool minus GET
# /api/orgo-computers). The sample settles the quartermaster's due lever
# actions. At staff.quartermaster.level = act (seed: observe) it records ONE
# lever action per orphan pool machine (at most
# staff.quartermaster.stops_max_run), then runs bin/fly-idle-reaper.sh act
# probe while staff.quartermaster.lever_dry_run is not 0, else act stop.
# One summary line per run in logs/staff-quartermaster-lever.log.
# Off: flags/lane-off-staff-quartermaster-lever (bin/harness-ctl.sh off
# staff-quartermaster-lever), or the staff kill flags (staff-off-all,
# staff-kill-all, staff-off-quartermaster, staff-kill-quartermaster).
49 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/staff/quartermaster-lever.sh >> /root/harness/logs/staff-quartermaster-lever-cron.log 2>&1
